              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Components: GALLERY-01, DATE-01, GUEST-01, BOOK-01, BOOK-STICKY-01\nEntry: Card / direct URL\nExit: Book Guest → Auth; Member → revalidate → WF-04\nStates: Default; availability/price → WF-03S\nI-08,24 / UXR-02,10,20,25\nAC: ปุ่มหลักจองที่พักนี้; ราคาเริ่มต้นไม่ใช่ quote",
