              "content": "Components: DATE-01, GUEST-01, PET-01\nEntry: Search fields\nExit: Save/search → origin/Results; Clear → unset\nStates: Calendar open / Range selected / Counter expanded\nI-01,02 / UXR-01,06\nAC: คนรวม + pets แยก; error → WF-10F; limits จริงยังเปิด",
